<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %> | Rumah Tools</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl shadow-md max-w-md w-full p-8 text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-4 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 text-2xl">
            ⚠️
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Anda akan meninggalkan Rumah Tools</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-5">
            Tautan singkat ini mengarah ke situs eksternal berikut. Rumah Tools tidak bertanggung jawab
            atas isi maupun keamanan situs tujuan.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono break-all mb-6 text-slate-700">
            <%= targetUrl %>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <a href="/tools/short-link"
               class="flex-1 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition text-sm font-medium">
                Batal
            </a>
            <a href="<%= targetUrl %>"
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
               class="flex-1 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white hover:bg-blue-700 transition text-sm font-medium">
                Lanjutkan ke situs tujuan
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
